na.\n\nFree.\nNo wallet connect.\nThe code is fully open source on dev's GitHub.\n\nThe craziest part: this thing is only a few days old.\n\nThe dev @0x_Punisher shipped all of this almost back to back, and the updates keep coming.\n\nNothing else I've used shows you the connections between wallets like this.\n\nIf you trade memecoins, scan before you buy.\n\nIt takes 15 seconds and can save you from the coin that takes your whole bag.\n\nHuge work done, big shoutout ot dev.\n\nUsing it every time before scanning any memecoin now.\n\nBtw native robinhood:0x19dcb63c4d2f29a6f077f094a4f858fc790145e1 token looks like this early gem that will go parabolic.\n\nNot sure why this tech is not sitting at millions yet.\n\nLooks like super early gem you'll be showing your friends after it goes parabolic one day.\n\nBidding here, based dev + crazy tech is all that's needed to 100x from here.\n\nThank me later.",
